                                  <div class="top30 ugov-of-pd-rules">
                    <div class="field--label">Attività a scelta e regole di composizione del piano didattico</div>
                                          <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-3"><div> - Students must earn 12 credits for elective activities to be chosen among those offered by this degree programme or by other degree programmes of both Universities. If a student decides to earn elective credits, partly or in full, through courses taught in a foreign language, such language cannot be the same as the student's own mother tongue. Students have to comply with all other obligations provided for by the academic rules of the degree programme, as laid down in art. 3.</div>
</div>
                                              <div class="ugov-of-pd-year-rules-af-3">
                          <table class="no-more-tables rs_content">
                            <thead>
                              <tr>
                                <th scope="col">Attività formative</th>
